{"about_the_game":"<strong>Netoo</strong> is a minimalist logic puzzle where you try to place small magnets into their correct spots by rotating transporter magnets with rotators. The difficulty of the game increases gradually, thanks to new mechanics introduced every 10 levels.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Rotate the machines using rotators<br></li><li>Move the magnets using opposite poles<br></li><li>Be careful with the boundaries!<br></li><li>Sometimes you'll have to think a bit</li></ul></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017520/extras/63131b539039f0f119aad6d0ab0d15cc.poster.avif?t=1759852764\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017520/extras/63131b539039f0f119aad6d0ab0d15cc.webm?t=1759852764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017520/extras/63131b539039f0f119aad6d0ab0d15cc.mp4?t=1759852764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40 levels (from simple to insufferably difficult)<br></li><li>3 unique mechanics<br></li><li>New mechanics introduced every 10 levels<br></li><li>Unlimited undo option<br></li><li>No text<br></li><li>Minimalist interface<br></li><li>Simple, relaxing, peaceful puzzle experience<br></li><li>Smooth animations for a fluid experience<br></li><li>Full gamepad support<br></li><li>Steam Achievements<br></li><li>Steam Cloud</li></ul></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Music and Sound Design by Emre Akdeniz &lt;3</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017520?t=1759852764","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017520/35ca9c20916ab9d3481aed84814922e24f7699e3/p